bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7fb093b7-c3a7-434e-8dd2-1e8f92b63f9f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the floor of the Feast Hall in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A record written in Raphael's own hand, detailing the adventures of various travellers in Faerûn, including yours.]\n</p><p><br>\nThe desperate will do anything to get out of a bind. That mind flayer toys with its food, but it'll become hungry soon enough, and they have proven such malleable little things. The Crown for the Hammer - more than a reasonable trade, I should think. After all, what use is power if you don't have freedom?\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715160437\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1597/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27782/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6687/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936197/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.449      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.449      1 -total\n 56.63%   25.736      7 Template:Icon_text\n 49.92%   22.688     17 Template:Trim\n 21.99%    9.992      2 Template:Uid\n 14.69%    6.676      2 Template:Icon_link\n 14.30% 